22
00:03:49,427 --> 00:04:00,348
[Host] On July sixteenth, the weather agency issued an early warning about high temperatures. Almost all of Japan, from Hokkaido to Okinawa, is covered by it.

23
00:04:00,948 --> 00:04:03,563
