25
00:04:11,187 --> 00:04:26,331
[Slow] これから約1か月、気温はいつもの年よりかなり高くなる予想です。「10年に一度」のレベルの暑さになるかもしれません。

26
00:04:27,132 --> 00:04:35,939
[Host] For about the next month, temperatures are expected to be much higher than in a normal year. It may become heat of a once-in-ten-years level.

27
